","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966","source_order":[59,45,0],"order":10458}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0146","name":"陈象","evidence":["santizhu059-q-97076d40bd0ef56ee0ae","santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-2841677f12a5060cc031","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-274375d798484d5833dc","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴历》曰：“晃入，口谏曰：‘太子仁明，显闻四海。今三方鼎峙，实不宜摇动太子，以生众心。愿陛下少垂圣虑；老臣虽死，犹生之年。’叩头流血，辞气不挠。权不纳晃言，斥还田里。","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fb0f95fd607adcc9639a","start":3,"end":87},{"id":"santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4d9a1f244fa09eb9eba6","layer":"original","quote":"权大怒，族诛正、象〖15〗；据、晃牵入殿，杖一百。﹝二﹞竟徙和于故鄣〖16〗。群司坐谏诛放者十数〖17〗。众咸冤之","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"santizhu059-q-97076d40bd0ef56ee0ae","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d8c890676807d68129bd","layer":"original","quote":"敕据、晃等“无事匆匆〖12〗”。权欲废和立亮。无难督陈正、五营督陈象上书〖13〗，称引“晋献公杀申生〖14〗，立奚齐，晋国扰乱”。又据、晃固谏不止","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":149}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
